text MoveTutor_Text_ThisMoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce {
	"This move can be learned only
	once. Is that okay?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTeach {
	"As a POKéfan, I really don't like hurting
	POKéMON when I go to catch them.

	It is a necessity however, so I
	developed a technique to inflict as 
	little pain as possible.

	Want me to teach your POKéMON how?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerDeclined {
	"What do you just like to hurt POKéMON
	or something?

	You should try being a better person."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerWhichMon {
	"Wow, you're such a good person like me.
	Which POKéMON should I do first?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTaught {
	"Good luck, catching more POKéMON and
	battling other trainers with them!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTeach {
	"What are you looking at, huh?

	It's because I'm fat, is that it?

	You know animals fatten up before
	hibernating for a reason!

	You know what, I can teach you and your
	POKéMON a thing or two if you want?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_RolloutDeclined {
	"That's just what I'd expect from a skin
	and bones loser like you!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_RolloutWhichMon {
	"Glad to see you're learning tolerance.
	Which one should I teach, then?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTaught {
	"That should help your POKéMON, but you
	should put on some pounds yourself."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTeach {
	"I taught my CHIMCHAR to throw berries
	at my sister.

	It's really funny!

	If you want, I can teach your POKéMON
	how to do it too!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterDeclined {
	"You have a lowsy sense of humor..."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterWhichMon {
	"Yay!
	Show me which POKéMON I should teach."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTaught {
	"Picking the right berry is the first key
	to success!"
}

text MoveTutor_MimicTeach {
	"Isn't it cool that I can swallow an
	entire hot dog in a single bite?

	I could teach you if you want.

	No, huh?
	Well, how about I teach one of your
	POKéMON instead, then?"
}

text MoveTutor_MimicDeclined {
	"Come on, man. I'm just trying to share
	my amazing talents with the world..."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MimicWhichMon {
	"Nice!
	Which one are we doing, then?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MimicTaught {
	"Yeah, your POKéMON is already a master!

	You could show it off in battle if you
	had some food stashed."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTeach {
	"What do you want?
	I'm try to buy some food, here.

	What's that?
	You're here to buy food as well?

	You're thinking right, kid.
	The more you eat, the more energy your
	body can EXPEND.

	If you want, I can teach your POKéMON
	how to best EXPEND their energy."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeDeclined {
	"That's a shame.
	I thought we were on the same page."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeWhichMon {
	"Good man!
	Which POKéMON, then?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTaught {
	"There you go, then.

	You know, using your POKéMON's energy
	effectively could be the difference
	between winning or losing a battle."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkTeach {
	"Humph! My wife relies on HIDDEN
	POWER to stay awake.

	She should just take a nap like I do,
	and SLEEP TALK.

	I can teach your POKéMON how to
	SLEEP TALK instead. Interested?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkDeclined {
	"Oh, fine, fine. You want to stay awake
	with HIDDEN POWER, too…"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkWhichMon {
	"Ah, an appreciative child!
	Which POKéMON should I teach?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SleepTalkTaught {
	"I've never once gotten my wife's
	coin trick right.

	I would be happy if I got it right
	even as I SLEEP TALK…"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTeach {
	"When I see the wide world from up
	here on the roof…

	I think about how nice it would be
	if there were more than just one me
	so I could enjoy all sorts of lives.

	Of course it's not possible.
	Giggle…

	I know! Would you be interested in
	having a POKéMON learn SUBSTITUTE?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteDeclined {
	"Oh, no?

	A POKéMON can make a copy of
	itself using it, you know."
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteWhichMon {
	"Giggle…
	Which POKéMON do you want me to
	teach SUBSTITUTE?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTaught {
	"We human beings should enjoy our
	own lives to the utmost!

	I hope you'll get that way, too!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchTeach {
	"I can't do this anymore!

	It's utterly hopeless!

	I'm a FIGHTING-type TRAINER,
	so I can't win at the MOSSDEEP GYM
	no matter how hard I try!

	Argh! Punch! Punch! Punch!
	Punch! Punch! Punch!

	What, don't look at me that way!
	I'm only hitting the ground!

	Or do you want me to teach your
	POKéMON DYNAMICPUNCH?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchDeclined {
	"Darn! You're even making fun of me?
	Punch! Punch! Punch!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchWhichMon {
	"What? You do? You're a good person!
	Which POKéMON should I teach?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DynamicPunchTaught {
	"I want you to win at the MOSSDEEP GYM
	using that DYNAMICPUNCH!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTeach {
	"Sigh…

	SOOTOPOLIS's GYM LEADER is really
	lovably admirable.

	But that also means I have many
	rivals for his attention.

	He's got appeal with a DOUBLE-EDGE.
	I couldn't even catch his eye.

	Please, let me teach your POKéMON
	the move DOUBLE-EDGE!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeDeclined {
	"Oh…
	Even you rejected me…"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeWhichMon {
	"Okay, which POKéMON should I teach
	DOUBLE-EDGE?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTaught {
	"I won't live for love anymore!
	I'll become tough!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTeach {
	"I don't intend to be going nowhere
	fast in the sticks like this forever.

	You watch me, I'll get out to the city
	and become a huge hit.

	Seriously, I'm going to cause
	a huge EXPLOSION of popularity!

	If you overheard that, I'll happily
	teach EXPLOSION to your POKéMON!"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionDeclined {
	"Gaah! You're turning me down because
	I live in the country?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionWhichMon {
	"Fine! An EXPLOSION it is!
	Which POKéMON wants to blow up?"
}

text MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTaught {
	"For a long time, I've taught POKéMON
	how to use EXPLOSION, but I've yet
	to ignite my own EXPLOSION…

	Maybe it's because deep down,
	I would rather stay here…"
}
